<title>SWEDEN: Esselte posts 12 pct rise in '96 profits.</title>
<headline>Esselte posts 12 pct rise in '96 profits.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish office supplier Esselte AB issues results for full year 1996.</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit			     667  vs    594</p>
<p> Sales				     11,625  vs 12,154</p>
<p> Earnings per share (SKR)	     12.50  vs  11.00</p>
<p> Costs of production		    7,836  vs  8,127</p>
<p> Admin and sales costs		  3,093  vs  3,314</p>
<p> Operating profit			   696  vs    713</p>
<p> Financial items		    CHARGE 29  vs    119 CHARGE</p>
<p> Tax					    240  vs    218</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-7001017</p>
</text>
